    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (2025-08-11 and 2026-03-06) lists the mix as 1 studio, 89 one-bedrooms, 33 two-bedrooms, 1 three-bedroom penthouse and 4 ground-floor townhome-style units, with 73 car and 148 bicycle spaces.",
