        "SRC-002846",
        "SRC-000732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY 2026-03-06 reports about 196,000 sq ft total, including 23,400 sq ft of parking and 5,950 sq ft of residential amenities, and a height of 85 feet; the 2025-08-11 article reported about 191,000 sq ft and 84 feet.",
