        "SRC-000732",
        "SRC-002846"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State 2025 Table A describes a SPAR application for 128 apartments and 73 parking spaces, using density bonus to waive Objective Design Standards and General Plan height limits; status Pending.",
